  "final_result": "Final answer (full):\n\n## Task\nFind the cheapest VPS in India with a **16 GB RAM** variant, and save the findings with source links under `outputs/`.\n\n## Deliverables saved\n- `outputs/cheapest-16gb-vps-india.md` — report with method, evidence quotes, access log, limits\n- `outputs/cheapest-16gb-vps-india.csv` — 10-provider comparison (Provider, Plan, RAM_GB, vCPU, Storage, Location, Price_INR_per_month, Currency, Billing_Term, Notes, Source_URL, Verified_UTC)\n- Final screenshot captured on the winning provider's page (attached above). Note: I did not modify any page content.\n\n## Answer (one total)\n**Cheapest 16 GB VPS in India: Host IT Smart — \"VPS - SM 3\" — ₹730/mo** (16 GB RAM, 4 vCPU, 200 GB SSD, 16 TB bandwidth, 1 dedicated IP, India).\n- Source: https://www.hostitsmart.com/servers/vps-hosting\n- Exact confirmation text: *\"VPS - SM 3 … 65% OFF … ₹730/mo* +6 Extra Months … Pay ₹17,520 for 24 months (regular price ₹50,160). Renews at ₹1,630/mo. 4 vCPU cores · 16 GB RAM · 200 GB SSD · 16 TB Bandwidth\"*; site banner *\"Pay 24 Months. Get 30 Months. 6 Are On Us.\"*; page also states *\"18% GST will be applicable\"*.\n- Worked out: ₹17,520 × 1.18 = **₹20,673.60** prepaid → **₹861.40/mo** over the 24 paid months, or **₹689.12/mo** over the 30 months delivered.\n\n**Cheapest monthly / no-lock-in alternative (a caveat, not the headline): VisiHost — \"Intel Xeon L\" — ₹899/mo** (16 GB DDR4, 6 vCores, 150 GB NVMe, Noida). Checkout: *\"Subtotal ₹899.00 / Gateway Processing Fee (2%) +₹17.98 / Total today ₹916.98\"*. Source: https://billing.visihost.in/products/vps-hosting-india/intel-xeon-l/checkout\n\n## Providers compared (all values read live this run)\nHost IT Smart 730 · VisiHost 899 · Matrix Host 999 · Kinetix Compute 999 · SkyRainCloud 1,169 · Host.co.in 1,299 · AquaHost 1,799 · AIC Cloud 2,049 · Inservers 3,600 · Rackyard US$12.56. Each row carries its exact source URL in the CSV.\n\n## Checks\n- Counts agree: 10 providers in both the message and the file; one headline answer (Host IT Smart).\n- Kinetix vCPU is blank in the CSV and labelled \"not shown\" with the reason.\n- Rackyard is USD and marked \"not converted\", so it is not ranked against INR prices.\n\n## Errors recovered\n- `bestvpsproviders.com` — `ERR_SOCKS_CONNECTION_FAILED`; abandoned, no value taken from it (unresolved, so excluded).\n- `www.inservers.com` — TLS `NET::ERR_CERT_COMMON_NAME_INVALID`; fixed by opening `inservers.com/vps/india`, which loaded and supplied the ₹3,600 data.\n- `host.co.in/vps-hosting` and `aquahost.in/vps-hosting` returned 404; fixed by using their real listing pages `/hosting/vps-hosting` and `/indian-vps`.\n\n## Limits\nOnly providers reachable from search were checked, so a smaller reseller below ₹730 could exist but was not found; several prices are Black Friday promotional; all prices exclude GST unless the page stated it.",
